<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>Planning Map 2025 Autumn ConFest </name>
    <description><![CDATA[𝓟𝓛𝓔𝓐𝓢𝓔 𝓔𝓓𝓘𝓣 𝓨𝓞𝓤𝓡 𝓛𝓐𝓨𝓔𝓡𝓢.<br>How-to edit the Autumn Planning Map: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1eh9b11jZxTlCmCmuxDAczOHNSSBO0fwyZ7oPOV4kyBE/edit?usp=sharing<br><br>ConFest site co-design for next event in Autumn. <br><br>* Mapping Facilitator: Dane Murray. <br>Email: confest.maps@gmail.com<br><br>LAYER EDITING BY:<br><br>* Market placements by Rainbow Unicorn & Murray<br><br>* Operations placements by Kel, Janni, Mark, Suzie, Sophie, Brett & Aaron<br><br>* Signage placements by Elisa<br><br>* Zones & Road placements by Sweet Heart<br><br>* Tap placements by Mark & John<br><br>* Loo placements by Aaron & Nathan<br><br>* Art Wayfinding placements by Star Child<br><br>* Village placements facilitated by Aaron and updated by all Village leads.<br><br>* Cooking Circle placements (TBA)<br><br>Please contact Layer Leaders listed to suggest any major adjustments :-D]]></description>
