      <Placemark>
        <name>Green Stay Put Camping</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Added by: Stay Put camping<br>Added when: <br>Data source: <br>description: # Stay Put camping (for Recreational Vehicles only) * Must be in by 5pm Thursday 18 April 2019 * Cannot leave till after midday Monday 22 April 2019 * Green permit required - For recreational vehicles, often abbreviated as RV, is a motor vehicle or trailer which includes living quarters designed for accommodation. * Types of RVs include motorhomes, campervans, caravans (also known as travel trailers and camper trailers), fifth-wheel trailers, popup campers and truck and van campers. * People with vehicle permits for Stay-Put who arrive after this time can camp in the Access camping area. https://www.confest.org.au/prepare/vehicle-parking<br>visited: <br>Name: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#line-7CB342-10627</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="Added by">
            <value>Stay Put camping</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Added when">
            <value/>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Data source">
            <value/>
          </Data>
          <Data name="description">
            <value># Stay Put camping (for Recreational Vehicles only) * Must be in by 5pm Thursday 18 April 2019 * Cannot leave till after midday Monday 22 April 2019 * Green permit required - For recreational vehicles, often abbreviated as RV, is a motor vehicle or trailer which includes living quarters designed for accommodation. * Types of RVs include motorhomes, campervans, caravans (also known as travel trailers and camper trailers), fifth-wheel trailers, popup campers and truck and van campers. * People with vehicle permits for Stay-Put who arrive after this time can camp in the Access camping area. https://www.confest.org.au/prepare/vehicle-parking</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="visited">
            <value/>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Name">
            <value/>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <LineString>
          <tessellate>1</tessellate>
          <coordinates>
            144.1476638,-35.146113,0
            144.1489918,-35.1469219,0
            144.1494426,-35.1469456,0
            144.1498375,-35.1470668,0
            144.1504756,-35.1473297,0
          </coordinates>
        </LineString>
