      <Placemark>
        <name>Stay Put camping</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: # Stay Put camping (for Recreational Vehicles only) * Must be in by 5pm Thursday 17 April 20125* Cannot leave till after midday Monday 21 April 2025 * Green permit required - For recreational vehicles, often abbreviated as RV, is a motor vehicle or trailer which includes living quarters designed for accommodation. * Types of RVs include motorhomes, campervans, caravans (also known as travel trailers and camper trailers), fifth-wheel trailers, popup campers and truck and van campers. * People with vehicle permits for Stay-Put who arrive after this time can camp in the Access camping area. https://www.confest.org.au/prepare/vehicle-parking<br>Added by: Kevin<br>Added when: May 2024<br>Data source: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#poly-7CB342-1-207</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value># Stay Put camping (for Recreational Vehicles only) * Must be in by 5pm Thursday 17 April 20125* Cannot leave till after midday Monday 21 April 2025 * Green permit required - For recreational vehicles, often abbreviated as RV, is a motor vehicle or trailer which includes living quarters designed for accommodation. * Types of RVs include motorhomes, campervans, caravans (also known as travel trailers and camper trailers), fifth-wheel trailers, popup campers and truck and van campers. * People with vehicle permits for Stay-Put who arrive after this time can camp in the Access camping area. https://www.confest.org.au/prepare/vehicle-parking</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Added by">
            <value>Kevin</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Added when">
            <value>May 2024</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="Data source">
            <value/>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
