      <Placemark>
        <name>Camp with your car</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: # Camp with your car ( for campers who camp next to their car and want to come and go ) * Access 9 - 6 Thursday, Friday, Saturday, Sunday, Monday, Tuesday * Pink permit required - This is the come-and-go camping areas. * At 6pm each festival night, the welcome gate will be locked and chain barrier at Tony’s Tip gate will be erected, to be reopened at 9am the following morning. https://www.confest.org.au/prepare/vehicle-parking<br>Added by: Kevin<br>Added when: May 2024<br>Data source: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#poly-F48FB1-1-191</styleUrl>
