            <value># Camp with your car ( for campers who camp next to their car and want to come and go ) * Access 9 - 6 Thursday, Friday, Saturday, Sunday, Monday, Tuesday * Pink permit required - This is the come-and-go camping areas. * At 6pm each festival night, the welcome gate will be locked and chain barrier at Tony’s Tip gate will be erected, to be reopened at 9am the following morning. https://www.confest.org.au/prepare/vehicle-parking</value>
